## How Encapsulation Works

```text
User class
-------------
private data

public methods
    ↓
controlled access
```

Memory idea:

```text
App → calls getter/setter → User class → private data
```

---

## Example with Validation

```java
class BankAccount {

    private double balance;

    public void deposit(double amount) {

        if(amount > 0) {
            balance += amount;
        }

    }

    public double getBalance() {
        return balance;
    }

}
```

Usage:

```java
BankAccount acc = new BankAccount();

