```java
User u = new User(16);
```

Output:

```
IllegalArgumentException: Age must be 18+
```

Object **will not be created**.

---

## Important Rule

If constructor throws exception:

```
Object creation fails
Constructor does not complete
```

Example flow:

```
new User(16)
      ↓
Constructor throws exception
      ↓
Object not created
```

