## 2. Abstract Factory Pattern

Abstract Factory creates **families of related objects**.

Basic idea:

```text id="9ntxjs"
Abstract Factory
      ↓
Multiple Factories
      ↓
Create related objects
```

### Example

Interfaces:

```java id="jpujyg"
interface Button {
    void paint();
}

interface Checkbox {
    void paint();
}
```

Implementations:

```java id="rct7il"
