### 1. Optimized DFS (Most Important 🔥 O(n))

```java id="bal1"
public class BalancedTree {

    static class Node {
        int val;
        Node left, right;
        Node(int v) { val = v; }
    }

    static boolean isBalanced(Node root) {
        return height(root) != -1;
    }

