### 3. Handle All Negative Nodes 🔥

```java id="mps3"
static int maxSum = Integer.MIN_VALUE;

static int dfs(Node root) {
    if (root == null) return 0;

    int left = dfs(root.left);
    int right = dfs(root.right);

    int single = Math.max(root.val,
                  root.val + Math.max(left, right));

    int top = Math.max(single, root.val + left + right);

    maxSum = Math.max(maxSum, top);

    return single;
}
```

