### 3. Sliding Window Counter 🔥 (Optimized)

```java id="rl3"
class SlidingWindowCounter {
    private final int limit;
    private final long windowSize;

    private long currWindowStart;
    private int currCount;
    private int prevCount;

    SlidingWindowCounter(int limit, long windowSize) {
        this.limit = limit;
        this.windowSize = windowSize;
        this.currWindowStart = System.currentTimeMillis();
    }

    public synchronized boolean allow() {
        long now = System.currentTimeMillis();

        if (now - currWindowStart >= windowSize) {
            prevCount = currCount;
            currCount = 0;
            currWindowStart = now;
        }

        double weight = (double)(windowSize - (now - currWindowStart)) / windowSize;
        double total = currCount + prevCount * weight;

        if (total < limit) {
            currCount++;
            return true;
        }

        return false;
    }
}
```

