### 1. Basic Retry with Exponential Backoff 🔥

```java id="rb1"
public class Retry {

    public static <T> T retry(Callable<T> task,
                              int maxAttempts,
                              long initialDelayMs) throws Exception {

        int attempt = 0;
        long delay = initialDelayMs;

        while (true) {
            try {
                return task.call();
            } catch (Exception e) {
                attempt++;

                if (attempt >= maxAttempts) {
                    throw e;
                }

                Thread.sleep(delay);
                delay *= 2; // exponential backoff
            }
        }
    }
}
```

