    void a();
    void b(); // ❌ more than 1 abstract method
}
```

---

## Allowed Along with 1 Abstract Method ✅

```java id="z6q1w7"
@FunctionalInterface
interface Demo {
    void run(); // only abstract method

    default void log() {}   // allowed
    static void util() {}   // allowed
}
```

